                                "sense_id": "3a4ce358-2e94-3934-a07e-03fb61ade744",
                                "text": "Albeit he is under the influence of the magic juice, Lysander's words to Hermia — once he has switched his romantic allegiance to Helena — are bitter, cruel. At times Benedick and Beatrice's verbal sparrings drip with an acidity that smarts."
                            }
                        ]
